ion markets price Hines near two-to-one odds. But expert raters are split between Tossup and Lean D, and the limited polling, all from Democratic-leaning sponsors, shows a tied contest. Bouchard holds a cash advantage, while Hines has drawn party support and outside help. The race remains genuinely competitive with a small Democratic edge.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6628, "margin": 2.54}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6491, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6831, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6477, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.623, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.5903, "margin": 2.0}]}